{\b Phase\textendash 2 Calculators (implemented)}\par
qSOFA, MEWS, HEART, GRACE (coarse), SOFA (minimal), D-dimer (age-adjusted; pregnancy aware), Troponin \u916?\u0327? (delta, absolute and percent), Wells PE/DVT, PERC, PESI + sPESI, SIRS, Sepsis-3 (with shock flag), Marburg, Glasgow-Blatchford (GI bleed), Child-Pugh, corrected calcium (albumin), anion gap (albumin-corrected).\par
