\par
{\b HL7 Merge (in UI)}\par
\bullet\ Parses OBX lines; extracts bilirubin, INR, albumin (unit-aware), troponin series (timestamped), and D-dimer (unit-aware).\par
\bullet\ Merges into Labs JSON: always writes troponin\_series; fills D-dimer + unit if available; merges bilirubin/INR/albumin.\par
\par
