{\b Troubleshooting Quicklist}\par
\bullet\ {\b UI doesn\lquote t show}: ensure CONFIG[\lquote RUN\_UI\rquote]=True; run bootstrap first.\par
\bullet\ {\b ML risk says bridge not loaded}: run bundle loader, then bridge cell; ensure CONFIG[\lquote MODEL\_BUNDLE\_PATH\rquote] points to the copied joblib under /kaggle/working.\par
\bullet\ {\b File not found for bundle}: verify dataset slug and filename (watch for \lquote (1)\rquote). Consider robust glob.\par
\bullet\ {\b Duplicate logs/prints}: make sure there is only one UI cell and one bridge; delete duplicate meds engines/UIs.\par
\bullet\ {\b HL7 values missing}: confirm OBX fields present; the merge fills bilirubin/INR/albumin and, if present, D-dimer (with unit) and troponin\_series.\par
